OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, dies in hospital after
OL,4,Abeing hit by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a bus, whose driver was
OL,8,Fsubsequently arrested.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,11,Fcollision at The Hard, Portsmouth, at
OL,12,F16:25 BST on Monday.
OL,14,FThe pedestrian was taken to hospital
OL,15,Fwith life-threatening injuries and has
OL,16,Fsince died, officers said.
OL,18,FA 39-year-old Portsmouth man was
OL,19,Farrested on suspicion of causing
OL,20,Fserious injury by dangerous driving and
OL,21,Fbailed until 17 November.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
